{"id":"chatcmpl-7a960190-512f-4d9e-882c-fa7f19c77781","object":"chat.completion","created":1795245769,"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","reasoning_content":"","content":"{\n  \"highlights\": \"The task required identifying a finding and its laterality in a medical image. The successful strategy combined expert consultation, grounded localization, and targeted verification to confirm the finding's location. Key patterns include using multiple tools to cross-validate spatial information and explicitly addressing laterality conventions.\",\n  \"patterns\": [\n    \"When a task involves determining laterality (left/right) in medical images, explicitly confirm standard radiological orientation to avoid confusion.\",\n    \"For visual question answering with multiple options, use a combination of expert opinion and grounded localization tools to cross-validate findings.\",\n    \"When options differ only by a spatial attribute (e.g., side), perform targeted verification queries for each candidate location to confirm presence or absence.\",\n    \"Leverage multiple specialized tools in sequence: first identify the finding, then localize it, then verify specific attributes.\"\n  ],\n  \"playbooks\": {\n    \"Medical Image Analysis\": \"Use expert tools to identify findings, then grounded localization to confirm location, and targeted queries to verify laterality or other spatial attributes.\",\n    \"Visual Question Answering with Options\": \"When options are similar but differ in a key attribute, design queries that specifically test that attribute for each option.\",\n    \"Tool Orchestration\": \"Chain tools logically: start with broad identification, then narrow down with localization, and finish with specific verification.\"\n  },\n  \"checklists\": [\n    \"Confirm that laterality is interpreted according to standard radiological orientation (patient's left is image right).\",\n    \"Cross-check findings from multiple tools to ensure consistency before finalizing the answer.\"\n  ]\n}"},"finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":488,"total_tokens":817,"completion_tokens":329,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":488},"completion_tokens_details":{"text_tokens":329}}}